{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/a1723b22e22d005101f5db12e81efe65.poster.avif?t=1773593475\" width=668 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/a1723b22e22d005101f5db12e81efe65.webm?t=1773593475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAVE US AND MAKE GAMEDEV GREAT AGAIN</h2><strong>You are MR DONALD \u2014 a leader who never quits. Elon, your trusted partner, is always by your side.</strong><br>The world is falling apart. The game industry is on its last breath. It all starts in the Vatican where <br>something went horribly wrong. From there begins your mission to save gamers\u2026 and the world itself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/fb0c124b4798001787e9c40b69391064.poster.avif?t=1773593475\" width=668 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/fb0c124b4798001787e9c40b69391064.webm?t=1773593475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405880/extras/fb0c124b4798001787e9c40b69391064.mp4?t=1773593475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE VATICAN HAS FALLEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a tragic incident, power in the Vatican has been seized by a developer syndicate \u2014 French freaks?!<br>They\u2019re obsessed with parkour, monetization, and something they call \u201chistorical accuracy.\u201d <br>They run experiments on their own employees, forcing them to wear robes at work\u2026 and<br>play their own games.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" a